WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:44.572
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:44.842 --> 00:48.655
It took us a long time to get here.

3
00:51.102 --> 00:54.816
I'm sorry I kept you waiting.

4
00:54.816 --> 00:58.986
I won't make you wait again.

5
00:58.986 --> 01:00.513
Ever.

6
01:38.446 --> 01:40.246
Woo Jae?

7
01:40.898 --> 01:42.142
What?

8
01:42.142 --> 01:43.439
Is this a dream?

9
01:47.194 --> 01:48.505
He's warm...

10
01:48.505 --> 01:50.564
This isn't a dream.

11
01:52.848 --> 01:54.659
It's me!

12
01:54.659 --> 01:56.168
This is my body.

13
01:56.168 --> 01:58.193
What's going on?

14
01:58.193 --> 02:00.983
Am I back? Why now?

15
02:03.885 --> 02:05.064
Cut.

16
02:05.670 --> 02:06.766
What was that?

17
02:06.766 --> 02:08.812
Did she just look at the camera?

18
02:09.492 --> 02:12.129
What's wrong, Ha Na?

19
02:12.129 --> 02:14.153
I'm really Yoon Ha Na...

20
02:14.153 --> 02:17.578
And I'm filming with him right now?

21
02:17.578 --> 02:19.490
Hey. What's wrong?

22
02:20.500 --> 02:22.701
Oh... well...

23
02:22.701 --> 02:23.805
Come on, Yoon Ha Na.

24
02:23.805 --> 02:25.858
Think! Make something up!

25
02:25.858 --> 02:27.234
A spider!

26
02:27.234 --> 02:28.354
It's gone now.

27
02:28.354 --> 02:30.330
That scared me. Sorry.

28
02:30.330 --> 02:31.664
Jeez, you scared me.

29
02:31.664 --> 02:32.908
Let's go again.

30
02:32.908 --> 02:34.101
Okay.

31
02:49.596 --> 02:50.787
How did this happen?

32
02:50.787 --> 02:53.716
Did I get my career back as the lead?

33
02:53.716 --> 02:55.270
Let's do it.

34
02:55.270 --> 02:56.717
Ready...

35
02:58.869 --> 03:00.180
Action.

36
03:01.362 --> 03:03.323
[Haesol Namchon]

37
03:03.323 --> 03:06.776
I'm sorry I kept you waiting.

38
03:06.776 --> 03:10.893
I won't make you wait again.

39
03:10.893 --> 03:12.478
Ever.

40
03:35.954 --> 03:37.486
[Episode 11]

41
03:49.208 --> 03:51.071
This is so much fun!

42
03:53.372 --> 03:54.515
Let's toast!

43
03:54.515 --> 03:56.174
Cheers!

44
03:56.174 --> 03:57.855
Nice work.

45
04:00.169 --> 04:01.512
What? Why?

46
04:01.512 --> 04:03.536
No actresses, no anchors,

47
04:03.536 --> 04:05.639
not even a chaebol heiress?

48
04:05.639 --> 04:07.356
No, thanks.

49
04:07.356 --> 04:09.909
The women already in my life are enough of a headache.

50
04:09.909 --> 04:11.339
- Dae Jun! - Yes?

51
04:11.339 --> 04:12.736
- Come here. - What?

52
04:12.736 --> 04:13.943
Talk some sense into him.

53
04:13.943 --> 04:15.631
You still don't get it?

54
04:15.631 --> 04:17.312
Ha Ru's got women lined up.

55
04:17.312 --> 04:18.535
It's not just gossip.

56
04:18.535 --> 04:21.535
He hasn't called anyone his girlfriend in ten years. Not since S.

57
04:21.535 --> 04:23.185
- Come on, man. - Oh, sorry.

58
04:23.185 --> 04:24.712
- Sorry. - "S?"

59
04:24.712 --> 04:26.749
Who was she?

60
04:26.749 --> 04:28.209
Your first love?

61
04:28.209 --> 04:29.632
- Come on, Dae Jun. Spill! - No way.

62
04:29.632 --> 04:30.933
You're better off not knowing.

63
04:30.933 --> 04:32.123
Just enjoy the moment!

64
04:32.123 --> 04:33.083
Whatever.

65
04:33.083 --> 04:34.847
Mind setting me up instead?

66
04:34.847 --> 04:36.093
Seriously?

67
04:36.093 --> 04:38.173
There he is. Chef Yoon's human shield.

68
04:38.173 --> 04:41.223
Chef Yoon's on a roll right now.

69
04:41.223 --> 04:43.993
Between the restaurant and his shoots,

70
04:43.993 --> 04:45.730
he barely has time to date.

71
04:45.730 --> 04:47.403
I see.

72
04:47.403 --> 04:49.077
You always take his side.

73
04:49.077 --> 04:50.214
Yeah.

74
04:50.214 --> 04:53.707
Must be nice having someone like him in your corner.

75
04:53.707 --> 04:55.651
Yeah, it is.

76
04:55.651 --> 04:56.902
Yeah!

77
04:56.902 --> 05:00.015
- All right, chefs! Great work! - Cheers.

78
05:02.176 --> 05:03.797
Excuse me.

79
05:07.851 --> 05:12.262
Chef Hong is totally wasted and asking for you guys.

80
05:13.003 --> 05:14.446
Dae Jun, let's go.

81
05:14.446 --> 05:16.506
What the heck...

82
05:16.506 --> 05:17.813
I'll be right back.

83
05:19.800 --> 05:21.172
Hey!

84
05:21.172 --> 05:22.355
Oh, you...

85
05:22.355 --> 05:23.814
Chef.

86
05:26.446 --> 05:28.356
Pyo Gyeong Woo?

87
05:28.356 --> 05:30.469
Wait... I'm a chef?

88
05:30.469 --> 05:31.627
What?

89
05:32.215 --> 05:34.000
Are you drunk, bro?

90
05:34.642 --> 05:36.091
"Bro?"

91
05:40.635 --> 05:42.225
This is my body!

92
05:44.782 --> 05:46.759
2026...

93
05:46.759 --> 05:48.952
Why now?

94
05:48.952 --> 05:50.355
What happened?

95
05:50.355 --> 05:51.415
Hey, bro.

96
05:51.415 --> 05:52.811
You'd better be ready for a long night.

97
05:52.811 --> 05:55.419
- You won 500 million won. - "500 million won?"

98
05:55.419 --> 05:58.530
Everyone says you're not going home tonight.

99
05:58.530 --> 06:00.403
Brace yourself.

100
06:01.498 --> 06:03.071
[Yoon Ha Na] Where are you?

101
06:06.432 --> 06:08.030
Hi, Ha Ru.

102
06:09.545 --> 06:11.056
Hi.

103
06:11.056 --> 06:12.635
Who are you again?

104
06:12.635 --> 06:14.305
Is that a joke?

105
06:14.305 --> 06:15.771
Why are you being so cute?

106
06:17.238 --> 06:19.318
Oh, yeah. I'm pretty cute.

107
06:19.318 --> 06:21.019
What's with you?

108
06:21.019 --> 06:23.944
Since when are you so formal with me?

109
06:23.944 --> 06:26.241
Oh, right.

110
06:26.241 --> 06:29.169
Guess I wasn't this polite before.

111
06:29.169 --> 06:32.438
I kind of like you being all polite.

112
06:34.492 --> 06:37.537
This is what I like about you, Ha Ru.

113
06:37.537 --> 06:39.961
You act all cold and tough,

114
06:39.961 --> 06:43.036
then you give me those innocent eyes.

115
06:43.036 --> 06:45.853
Want to come to my place tonight?

116
06:45.853 --> 06:48.577
Your place?

117
06:48.577 --> 06:49.921
Yoon Ha Ru, you psycho...

118
06:49.921 --> 06:53.426
What the hell have you been doing with your life?

119
06:54.102 --> 06:55.925
Good to see you!

120
06:55.925 --> 06:57.804
- Oh, Gyeong Woo... - How have you been?

121
06:57.804 --> 06:59.380
You got even prettier.

122
06:59.380 --> 07:02.090
- How do you always look so good? - I'll get going!

123
07:02.090 --> 07:04.189
Come over here.

124
07:25.863 --> 07:27.374
I love you.

125
07:33.659 --> 07:35.843
Get a grip, Yoon Ha Na!

126
07:35.843 --> 07:39.607
I need to get it together...

127
07:56.620 --> 07:59.137
You okay?

128
07:59.137 --> 08:00.821
Of course.

129
08:00.821 --> 08:02.743
I'm more than okay.

130
08:04.526 --> 08:06.156
Doesn't look like it.

131
08:06.156 --> 08:08.330
You feel warm...

132
08:08.330 --> 08:09.780
What's wrong with you, Yoon Ha Na?

133
08:09.780 --> 08:11.655
You're not a teenager anymore...

134
08:14.193 --> 08:16.217
Looks like I'll be here all night.

135
08:16.217 --> 08:18.191
Text me when you get home.

136
08:18.191 --> 08:21.141
And if you start feeling sick, call me right away.

137
08:21.141 --> 08:22.994
Okay. Don't worry.

138
08:22.994 --> 08:24.214
Yeah.

139
08:34.424 --> 08:36.538
Good work, Kkomi.

140
08:38.552 --> 08:39.958
Oh my.

141
08:41.246 --> 08:43.166
Stand by, please!

142
08:44.812 --> 08:46.501
- Go on. - Yeah.

143
08:50.485 --> 08:53.018
Good to see you, Ha Na.

144
09:04.762 --> 09:06.087
What?

145
09:06.087 --> 09:09.926
We've been filming together all day... What's with "good to see you?"

146
09:09.926 --> 09:12.370
And what's with "Kkomi?"

147
09:12.370 --> 09:15.099
Must be his pet name for me.

148
09:15.099 --> 09:16.717
That's so cute.

149
09:16.717 --> 09:19.609
I'm seriously losing it.

150
09:21.539 --> 09:23.256
Ha Na?

151
09:23.256 --> 09:24.533
Yeah.

152
09:24.533 --> 09:26.221
Let's go, Seok Min.

153
09:36.183 --> 09:39.522
Only one month till the final shoot.

154
09:42.077 --> 09:47.702
Ha Na. Shouldn't we start picking out your red-carpet dress?

155
09:47.702 --> 09:51.506
What? We haven't even finished the movie yet.

156
09:51.506 --> 09:54.570
I'm telling you, this could be the role of your career.

157
09:54.570 --> 09:56.736
And it's not just me.

158
09:56.736 --> 10:01.402
Everyone says once this comes out, Best Actress is yours.

159
10:01.402 --> 10:02.897
Best Actress?

160
10:02.897 --> 10:08.059
Other actors get one big break and start racking up trophies.

161
10:08.059 --> 10:10.429
But you always get Popularity Awards.

162
10:10.429 --> 10:13.110
It drives me crazy.

163
10:14.716 --> 10:15.721
Still...

164
10:15.721 --> 10:19.929
Woo Jae and Jun Mo teamed up and said the role had to be yours.

165
10:19.929 --> 10:24.146
They didn't even send the script to any other actresses.

166
10:24.146 --> 10:25.332
That's pretty touching.

167
10:25.332 --> 10:28.532
They teamed up?

168
10:28.532 --> 10:31.094
Oh, right...

169
10:41.536 --> 10:42.814
The camcorder...

170
10:42.814 --> 10:44.356
It's gone.

171
10:54.180 --> 10:55.938
As you can see...

172
10:55.938 --> 10:59.500
We found bugs and tracking devices

173
10:59.500 --> 11:04.866
in the living room, kitchen, bedroom, and car.

174
11:04.866 --> 11:08.899
I bet there's more if we keep looking.

175
11:08.899 --> 11:09.924
Wow...

176
11:09.924 --> 11:15.192
So this really does happen in celebrities' homes.

177
11:15.192 --> 11:16.223
Hey, look at this.

178
11:16.223 --> 11:17.562
- She's pretty, right? - I don't know...

179
11:17.562 --> 11:21.360
So Ha Na's still the target.

180
11:21.360 --> 11:23.226
- She's pretty. - Not really.

181
11:24.222 --> 11:27.905
Whoever planted them will know they've gone dead.

182
11:27.905 --> 11:29.981
They'll probably make another move soon.

183
11:31.733 --> 11:33.837
Good.

184
11:33.837 --> 11:36.607
I've been wanting to see who's behind this.

185
11:36.607 --> 11:38.710
- Okay. - Yeah...

186
11:50.304 --> 11:51.655
It's Yoon Ha Na!

187
11:51.655 --> 11:53.454
No way!

188
11:53.454 --> 11:54.611
- Wow! - Hello.

189
11:54.611 --> 11:55.952
- I'm... - Move over!

190
11:55.952 --> 11:57.652
I'm Lee Gyeong Min.

191
11:57.652 --> 11:59.367
Come take a picture of us.

192
11:59.367 --> 12:00.746
Mind if I put my arm around you?

193
12:00.746 --> 12:01.910
- Sure. - Thank you.

194
12:01.910 --> 12:04.383
- Hurry up and take it. - A picture? Okay.

195
12:04.383 --> 12:06.120
Chef, could you take our picture?

196
12:06.120 --> 12:08.404
- Just take mine... - Hold on!

197
12:08.404 --> 12:10.902
- What the... - Could you take a picture for us?

198
12:10.902 --> 12:12.867
Just the three of us, please.

199
12:12.867 --> 12:13.880
Just us.

200
12:13.880 --> 12:15.340
- Just the three of us. - You can step out.

201
12:15.340 --> 12:16.800
- The three of us. - Not you.

202
12:16.800 --> 12:18.158
Yeah, yeah.

203
12:18.158 --> 12:19.425
All right, here we go.

204
12:19.425 --> 12:22.312
One, two, three.

205
12:26.659 --> 12:28.582
So... what's going on?

206
12:28.582 --> 12:31.115
That's what I'm asking.

207
12:32.069 --> 12:33.239
The camcorder!

208
12:33.239 --> 12:35.305
It was in your room.

209
12:35.305 --> 12:38.241
Weren't you and Woo Jae the only ones home?

210
12:38.241 --> 12:41.450
What? You think Woo Jae took the battery out?

211
12:41.450 --> 12:42.581
Why would he?

212
12:42.581 --> 12:44.009
How would I know?

213
12:44.009 --> 12:46.109
You were the one with him.

214
12:46.768 --> 12:48.749
What changed this time?

215
12:48.749 --> 12:51.515
Why did the camcorder disappear?

216
12:51.515 --> 12:53.465
The last video you recorded...

217
12:53.465 --> 12:55.585
was in 2017.

218
12:55.585 --> 12:57.648
Our last time jump...

219
12:57.648 --> 12:59.747
Maybe it disappeared once its job was done.

220
12:59.747 --> 13:02.603
And that's why we're not switching bodies anymore?

221
13:02.603 --> 13:04.182
Who knows?

222
13:04.182 --> 13:06.350
Maybe there's another rule.

223
13:06.350 --> 13:08.671
Or maybe the magic just wore off.

224
13:09.749 --> 13:10.767
Anyway...

225
13:10.767 --> 13:13.020
Woo Jae's alive, and you two are together.

226
13:13.020 --> 13:14.857
And you...

227
13:14.857 --> 13:17.523
You're not back where you were, but you're doing better than last time.

228
13:17.523 --> 13:20.561
You're getting lead roles again instead of being stuck in supporting roles.

229
13:20.561 --> 13:24.540
And you're a famous chef now...

230
13:24.540 --> 13:27.008
So we're good. Right?

231
13:27.008 --> 13:31.548
First, I need to sort things out with Ye Rang.

232
13:38.044 --> 13:39.396
[Boss] [No search results]

233
13:42.628 --> 13:43.937
[CEO Seo Ye Rang]

234
13:45.493 --> 13:47.562
"CEO Seo Ye Rang?"

235
13:47.562 --> 13:51.711
That's the least romantic contact name ever.

236
13:58.758 --> 14:00.906
The person you are calling is unavailable...

237
14:00.906 --> 14:03.743
Why isn't she picking up?

238
14:03.743 --> 14:07.576
Don't tell me I screwed up again.

239
14:07.576 --> 14:09.709
You probably did.

240
14:10.302 --> 14:12.022
Yeah, probably.

241
14:12.758 --> 14:14.402
Man, this sucks.

242
14:14.402 --> 14:17.403
It was nine years ago. I can't even get mad about it now.

243
14:19.167 --> 14:21.267
Whatever.

244
14:21.267 --> 14:23.070
I'll sort things out with her.

245
14:23.070 --> 14:26.457
She'll come around soon.

246
14:26.457 --> 14:28.115
Look at this.

247
14:30.716 --> 14:32.376
What's this?

248
14:33.061 --> 14:36.617
"Jung Woo Jae, Director Yang Jun Mo's Muse?"

249
14:38.287 --> 14:40.257
What's with these two now?

250
14:40.257 --> 14:41.711
How did this happen?

251
14:41.711 --> 14:44.455
We don't even have the camcorder anymore.

252
14:44.455 --> 14:46.921
So why are Woo Jae and Jun Mo...

253
14:47.663 --> 14:49.256
Yeah...

254
14:53.638 --> 14:56.254
When things get complicated, keep it simple.

255
14:56.254 --> 14:57.532
What?

256
14:58.128 --> 15:01.297
This is basically our happy ending, right?

257
15:01.978 --> 15:05.384
Aside from Ye Rang being pissed at me.

258
15:06.000 --> 15:07.760
Well...

259
15:07.760 --> 15:08.779
I guess.

260
15:08.779 --> 15:10.803
If nothing else happens.

261
15:10.803 --> 15:14.357
We just have to deal with Yang Jun Mo and Park Gi Tae.

262
15:14.357 --> 15:16.387
Oh, how?

263
15:16.387 --> 15:19.650
Guess we should start figuring that out.

264
15:19.650 --> 15:21.184
Seriously...

265
15:45.509 --> 15:47.258
Did you get some rest?

266
15:47.892 --> 15:50.126
Oh, yeah.

267
15:50.126 --> 15:51.203
Are we heading back?

268
15:51.203 --> 15:52.361
We still have a little time.

269
15:52.361 --> 15:54.013
They're setting up the lights.

270
15:54.013 --> 15:55.266
Okay.

271
15:57.026 --> 15:59.072
About Ha Na today...

272
16:00.353 --> 16:02.366
Didn't she seem a little off?

273
16:05.260 --> 16:06.737
Really?

274
16:06.737 --> 16:08.577
I didn't notice anything.

275
16:08.577 --> 16:09.956
Yeah?

276
16:16.764 --> 16:18.130
Why?

277
16:20.712 --> 16:23.044
Never mind. Get some rest.

278
16:36.775 --> 16:41.018
"Eun Soo falls asleep on the couch while watching a movie."

279
16:41.802 --> 16:44.519
She really fell asleep?

280
16:44.519 --> 16:48.305
The script changed.

281
17:21.740 --> 17:23.537
Eun Soo...

282
17:23.537 --> 17:26.610
It's time for you to go back where you belong.

283
17:26.610 --> 17:28.716
I'll keep the past safe.

284
17:29.361 --> 17:31.125
In the future...

285
17:31.125 --> 17:33.558
don't give anything up.

286
17:35.047 --> 17:37.259
Keep chasing your dreams.

287
17:49.091 --> 17:51.928
Do you think it really was Woo Jae?

288
17:51.928 --> 17:53.025
I don't know...

289
17:53.025 --> 17:55.766
We have a month until the final shoot.

290
17:56.399 --> 17:57.431
Yeah.

291
17:57.431 --> 18:00.152
And we can't go back to the past anymore.

292
18:00.152 --> 18:01.359
Right.

293
18:03.643 --> 18:05.890
You know what that means, right?

294
18:09.728 --> 18:12.506
It means something?

295
18:12.506 --> 18:17.110
Everything we do from now on is permanent.

296
18:19.457 --> 18:21.956
Oh, got it.

297
18:21.956 --> 18:24.126
You, me,

298
18:24.126 --> 18:25.551
and Woo Jae...

299
18:25.551 --> 18:27.390
We all need to be careful.

300
18:28.071 --> 18:29.377
Okay.

301
18:32.578 --> 18:34.321
Miss you.

302
18:34.321 --> 18:36.001
What time should I come over tomorrow?

303
18:36.001 --> 18:37.597
What is it?

304
18:37.597 --> 18:38.639
Why?

305
18:38.639 --> 18:41.348
Woo Jae's coming over.

306
18:41.348 --> 18:42.879
So?

307
18:43.678 --> 18:45.953
A date at my place.

308
18:47.298 --> 18:49.064
Darn it.

309
18:50.297 --> 18:52.070
Beats me.

310
19:23.006 --> 19:24.572
Come in.

311
19:50.212 --> 19:52.336
You're good at everything, Kkomi.

312
19:52.336 --> 19:53.656
You make great coffee too.

313
19:53.656 --> 19:55.409
You could be a barista.

314
19:56.020 --> 19:58.490
Really? It's that good?

315
19:58.490 --> 20:00.777
Want me to start looking at places tomorrow?

316
20:00.777 --> 20:02.134
I could open you a cafe.

317
20:02.134 --> 20:04.267
A cafe?

318
20:04.267 --> 20:07.454
Thanks, but my day job keeps me busy enough.

319
20:07.454 --> 20:08.907
Right.

320
20:10.107 --> 20:11.664
But...

321
20:11.664 --> 20:14.730
Why do you call me Kkomi again?

322
20:21.136 --> 20:22.633
Because you're my little one.

323
20:22.633 --> 20:24.005
That's where "Kkomi" comes from.

324
20:24.005 --> 20:26.039
Oh my, Jung Woo Jae...

325
20:26.039 --> 20:30.689
You even came up with a nickname as cute as you.

326
20:33.880 --> 20:37.240
So... now that we're caffeinated...

327
20:38.030 --> 20:41.083
Ready to get started?

328
20:41.083 --> 20:43.920
"Get started?"

329
20:45.073 --> 20:46.764
Jung Woo Jae...

330
20:46.764 --> 20:50.477
When did you get this bold?

331
20:50.477 --> 20:52.386
What am I supposed to do?

332
21:02.626 --> 21:03.857
The script?

333
21:03.857 --> 21:06.702
Yeah. We said we'd rehearse together.

334
21:10.170 --> 21:12.087
We can start with this line.

335
21:12.789 --> 21:14.842
- Here. - Okay.

336
21:16.585 --> 21:18.158
All right.

337
21:20.949 --> 21:24.340
[Chef Yoon Ha Ru &amp; Nurungji Milk Cream Brûlée] It's been way too long!

338
21:24.340 --> 21:25.849
Ye Rang hasn't changed a bit either.

339
21:25.849 --> 21:29.179
Chef Yoon, star quality really runs in your family.

340
21:29.179 --> 21:31.678
Seriously, how do you look this good on camera?

341
21:31.678 --> 21:33.222
Oh, please.

342
21:33.222 --> 21:36.682
I hear you're directing every commercial in Korea these days.

343
21:36.682 --> 21:39.272
Everyone's talking about you.

344
21:39.272 --> 21:41.032
How'd you hear about that?

345
21:41.032 --> 21:44.610
You've got a good eye, Seo Ye Rang.

346
21:44.610 --> 21:45.996
Of course I do.

347
21:45.996 --> 21:49.395
Just trust me and follow my lead on this one too.

348
21:50.309 --> 21:53.939
Oh, there she is!

349
21:53.939 --> 21:56.993
This is CEO Seo Ye Rang.

350
21:56.993 --> 21:58.510
And here's our star.

351
21:58.510 --> 22:00.566
I like your style.

352
22:03.739 --> 22:09.146
Looks like we have similar taste. I think we'll get along.

353
22:10.119 --> 22:13.570
Director Choi, I loved the storyboard.

354
22:13.570 --> 22:15.796
My work usually has that effect.

355
22:15.796 --> 22:20.518
But maybe I cast the wrong model.

356
22:21.238 --> 22:26.113
I can't take my eyes off Chef Yoon long enough to notice the product.

357
22:26.113 --> 22:27.732
Is it just me?

358
22:30.503 --> 22:31.873
Oh, right.

359
22:31.873 --> 22:33.813
Do you know Pierre Moreau?

360
22:33.813 --> 22:35.593
Of course.

361
22:35.593 --> 22:38.147
He's huge in French cuisine.

362
22:38.147 --> 22:40.923
He's doing a secret pop-up in Korea.

363
22:40.923 --> 22:44.791
I managed to get two seats.

364
22:44.791 --> 22:45.803
Oh, really?

365
22:45.803 --> 22:47.633
I'd love that. Thank you.

366
22:47.633 --> 22:49.868
So, shall we start the meeting?

367
22:49.868 --> 22:51.469
Right this way.

368
22:54.029 --> 22:56.877
"I'm not letting you give up anything else."

369
22:57.503 --> 23:00.583
"From now on, I'll protect you. Eun Soo."

370
23:03.922 --> 23:06.530
- Want to take a break? - Yeah.

371
23:06.530 --> 23:08.445
Want something to drink?

372
23:19.508 --> 23:21.170
What is it?

373
23:21.895 --> 23:23.133
Ha Na...

374
23:23.133 --> 23:25.068
I was just wondering...

375
23:25.068 --> 23:26.334
Yeah?

376
23:29.321 --> 23:30.761
Never mind.

377
23:34.808 --> 23:37.061
I missed you so much.

378
23:40.350 --> 23:41.735
What?

379
23:41.735 --> 23:44.214
We've been together all day.

380
23:44.214 --> 23:47.253
And we see each other almost every day on set.

381
23:47.860 --> 23:51.195
That's totally different.

382
24:23.934 --> 24:28.072
Can I sleep here tonight?

383
24:31.178 --> 24:32.628
Yeah.

384
24:32.628 --> 24:34.228
Stay.

385
24:35.027 --> 24:37.026
I want to be with you.

386
25:00.522 --> 25:03.787
A fresh twist on a familiar nutty flavor!

387
25:03.787 --> 25:06.612
On Daily with Chef Yoon Ha Ru!

388
25:06.612 --> 25:09.020
That concludes the presentation.

389
25:10.615 --> 25:11.965
Did you like it?

390
25:11.965 --> 25:13.602
Okay? Okay?

391
25:13.602 --> 25:14.745
Okay!

392
25:14.745 --> 25:16.267
One more round of applause!

393
25:17.388 --> 25:19.787
Let's move on to the next meeting.

394
25:23.420 --> 25:24.847
Let's go.

395
25:26.063 --> 25:27.533
See you again soon.

396
25:27.533 --> 25:29.237
- I'll be in touch. - Okay.

397
25:29.237 --> 25:30.839
Have a safe trip.

398
25:32.449 --> 25:34.376
I'll call you later.

399
25:34.376 --> 25:35.729
Ma'am...

400
25:37.940 --> 25:39.061
Good work.

401
25:39.061 --> 25:40.950
Oh, wait.

402
25:41.743 --> 25:44.293
Aren't we getting dinner?

403
25:44.293 --> 25:47.399
I worked hard today. You're not even buying me something good?

404
25:48.695 --> 25:50.571
- Director Pyo. - Yes.

405
25:50.571 --> 25:52.664
You have the company card I gave you, right?

406
25:52.664 --> 25:56.911
Use it to get Chef Yoon something nice to eat.

407
25:56.911 --> 25:58.383
Yes, ma'am!

408
25:58.978 --> 26:00.458
But...

409
26:00.458 --> 26:02.011
Oh, right.

410
26:03.846 --> 26:05.870
And your style today...

411
26:05.870 --> 26:07.870
Your worst look yet.

412
26:10.576 --> 26:12.216
Bye.

413
26:14.575 --> 26:16.146
Boss...

414
26:16.146 --> 26:18.689
You're really going this far?

415
26:21.987 --> 26:23.860
- Hey. - Yes?

416
26:23.860 --> 26:26.383
We broke up nine years ago,

417
26:26.383 --> 26:30.553
and then she signed me to her agency two years later.

418
26:30.553 --> 26:32.350
What do you think?

419
26:32.350 --> 26:33.776
Can't you tell?

420
26:33.776 --> 26:35.109
[Exclusive Management Agreement]

421
26:41.517 --> 26:45.368
What is this?

422
26:45.368 --> 26:47.880
I didn't call you here to get your hopes up.

423
26:47.880 --> 26:49.763
I'm making you this offer

424
26:49.763 --> 26:52.554
because I see value and potential in you.

425
26:52.554 --> 26:54.231
You'll like the terms.

426
26:54.231 --> 26:57.639
If you don't have any special requests, sign it.

427
26:57.639 --> 26:59.958
CEO Seo's all business.

428
26:59.958 --> 27:02.751
But in the end,

429
27:02.751 --> 27:05.384
it worked out for both of you.

430
27:07.823 --> 27:10.086
Oh, right.

431
27:10.086 --> 27:12.994
Look at this.

432
27:12.994 --> 27:14.531
[CEO S in Secret Marriage Talks with Heir to Top-10 Conglomerate]

433
27:14.531 --> 27:15.610
I think...

434
27:15.610 --> 27:18.441
I'm going to like you even more, Ye Rang.

435
27:18.441 --> 27:20.231
- What? - Oh my...

436
27:20.231 --> 27:22.365
That bastard...

437
27:22.365 --> 27:25.578
He's the guy from the hotel cafe!

438
27:44.853 --> 27:48.826
I'm never letting you go again.

439
27:50.067 --> 27:54.161
You're what romance means to me now.

440
27:55.182 --> 27:57.119
You know...

441
27:57.119 --> 28:00.416
I hope you live a happy life,

442
28:00.416 --> 28:02.359
and a long one at that.

443
28:02.359 --> 28:05.936
You're so cute.

444
28:08.939 --> 28:10.589
For me...

445
28:10.589 --> 28:14.673
the fact that I can love you with everything I have...

446
28:14.673 --> 28:16.745
just gives me so much joy.

447
28:16.745 --> 28:18.572
It makes me happy.

448
28:37.018 --> 28:38.941
I know everything now.

449
28:39.546 --> 28:41.789
You went back to the past to save me,

450
28:41.789 --> 28:44.523
and gave up the things that mattered most to you.

451
28:44.523 --> 28:46.193
You can stop now.

452
28:46.193 --> 28:48.486
I did it because I wanted to.

453
28:54.169 --> 28:58.834
Now I'm going to do what I want.

454
29:00.257 --> 29:04.521
I'm not letting you give up anything else.

455
29:04.521 --> 29:07.914
From now on, I'll protect you. Eun Soo.

456
29:11.245 --> 29:12.501
Cut! Okay.

457
29:12.501 --> 29:14.209
Okay!

458
29:20.843 --> 29:23.036
- And this time... - Got it.

459
29:33.033 --> 29:35.570
Hello, sir.

460
29:35.570 --> 29:37.870
Oh, what brings you here?

461
29:37.870 --> 29:39.400
Well...

462
29:39.400 --> 29:41.826
My sister's here... and a friend too.

463
29:41.826 --> 29:44.066
Figured I'd stop by.

464
29:45.527 --> 29:46.793
Yeah.

465
29:47.394 --> 29:50.076
Sir. About that prop you mentioned...

466
29:50.076 --> 29:52.603
It should be ready soon.

467
29:55.070 --> 29:56.700
- Seok Min. - Yes?

468
29:56.700 --> 29:58.600
I'm going to get some air.

469
29:58.600 --> 30:00.219
Okay.

470
30:00.219 --> 30:01.806
Darn it.

471
30:10.874 --> 30:12.375
Seo Ye Rang.

472
30:23.572 --> 30:24.889
What is it?

473
30:24.889 --> 30:26.440
You have something to say?

474
30:27.040 --> 30:28.958
Yeah, I do.

475
30:31.265 --> 30:33.757
I saw the rumor.

476
30:34.899 --> 30:36.502
It's not true, right?

477
30:36.502 --> 30:38.099
You wouldn't do that.

478
30:38.099 --> 30:39.458
Right?

479
30:41.105 --> 30:42.760
You really...

480
30:44.366 --> 30:48.018
You don't love me anymore?

481
30:49.231 --> 30:50.962
Do you think I'm a joke?

482
30:50.962 --> 30:52.211
What?

483
30:53.291 --> 30:55.768
How did you even get there?

484
30:55.768 --> 30:57.718
Do I still look like that pathetic girl

485
30:57.718 --> 31:01.011
who clung to you and...

486
31:01.011 --> 31:03.470
begged you to love me?

487
31:04.103 --> 31:06.451
- What are you... - Enough.

488
31:07.040 --> 31:11.600
If you don't want to ruin what we have now,

489
31:11.600 --> 31:13.492
then at least show me...

490
31:14.199 --> 31:15.712
a little respect.

491
31:58.093 --> 31:59.799
[Yoon Ha Na]

492
32:02.880 --> 32:04.655
Hey, Oranges!

493
32:04.655 --> 32:07.095
Welcome to Cool Guy's Take. I'm Minu.

494
32:07.095 --> 32:09.586
We have a very special guest today.

495
32:09.586 --> 32:11.233
Star of The Chef Show

496
32:11.233 --> 32:13.144
and winner of Chef Wars!

497
32:13.144 --> 32:14.270
If you...

498
32:14.270 --> 32:16.899
don't want to ruin what we have now,

499
32:16.899 --> 32:19.376
then at least show me a little respect.

500
32:19.376 --> 32:22.233
Chef Yoon Ha Ru!

501
32:22.233 --> 32:23.973
Great to have you here.

502
32:24.830 --> 32:27.024
Chef?

503
32:29.643 --> 32:30.796
Yes?

504
32:31.716 --> 32:33.836
Oh, sorry.

505
32:34.689 --> 32:37.613
You seem pretty nervous.

506
32:37.613 --> 32:41.691
Why don't we loosen up with our first story?

507
32:41.691 --> 32:42.971
Sure!

508
32:45.056 --> 32:48.233
This one's from "Hopeless Romantic," an office worker in her early 30s.

509
32:48.233 --> 32:50.257
"I dated my ex for four years in my 20s.

510
32:50.257 --> 32:54.718
We broke up three years ago, but I still can't get over him.

511
32:55.519 --> 32:58.166
My ex was everything to me in my 20s.

512
32:58.166 --> 33:02.762
But he started putting his career and success first.

513
33:02.762 --> 33:04.232
Before I knew it,

514
33:04.232 --> 33:06.300
I was the only one still holding on...

515
33:06.300 --> 33:08.592
practically begging him to love me."

516
33:08.592 --> 33:10.345
Do I still look like that pathetic girl...

517
33:10.345 --> 33:13.019
who clung to you and...

518
33:13.019 --> 33:15.432
begged you to love me?

519
33:15.432 --> 33:17.709
"In the end, I broke up with him.

520
33:17.709 --> 33:19.329
It's been three years now.

521
33:19.329 --> 33:22.666
So why can't I stop thinking about him?"

522
33:22.666 --> 33:23.990
All right.

523
33:23.990 --> 33:27.800
What advice would you give our "Hopeless Romantic?"

524
33:35.829 --> 33:38.395
"Hopeless Romantic."

525
33:40.112 --> 33:42.215
That guy's...

526
33:42.902 --> 33:48.103
probably living with regret right now.

527
33:49.718 --> 33:51.631
I know exactly how he feels.

528
33:52.399 --> 33:54.429
I've been there.

529
33:56.426 --> 33:59.039
We broke up nine years ago.

530
34:01.799 --> 34:03.572
I still...

531
34:04.366 --> 34:08.041
I still love her.

532
34:08.885 --> 34:12.123
Is this a public confession?

533
34:12.123 --> 34:13.680
"A public confession?"

534
34:14.810 --> 34:17.424
I guess it is.

535
34:18.470 --> 34:21.668
Let's call it that.

536
34:25.196 --> 34:28.593
My biggest regret in life...

537
34:28.593 --> 34:32.353
is that I was so busy chasing success,

538
34:32.353 --> 34:37.407
I never realized how lonely she was.

539
34:37.407 --> 34:41.580
If I ever get another chance with her...

540
34:43.212 --> 34:48.549
I'll devote every day I have to her.

541
34:49.265 --> 34:51.281
I loved her then...

542
34:51.281 --> 34:57.861
and I still love her very much.

543
35:00.170 --> 35:02.860
A confession nine years later!

544
35:02.860 --> 35:06.668
Do you think she's listening right now?

545
35:06.668 --> 35:10.410
- You bastard... - I hope things work out for both

546
35:10.410 --> 35:12.342
"Hopeless Romantic" and Chef Ha Ru.

547
35:12.342 --> 35:14.864
Let's move on to our next story.

548
35:17.757 --> 35:19.223
[Kang Do Hoon]

549
35:37.815 --> 35:40.041
I heard your show earlier.

550
35:41.055 --> 35:42.525
You okay?

551
35:42.525 --> 35:44.284
Of course.

552
35:45.435 --> 35:48.932
Once I take care of everything, I'll win Boss's heart back.

553
35:48.932 --> 35:50.380
Don't worry.

554
35:50.380 --> 35:52.081
You know who I am.

555
35:56.475 --> 35:58.421
Ugh, my head...

556
35:59.095 --> 36:00.205
When are they getting here?

557
36:00.205 --> 36:02.632
- What? - I'm just asking...

558
36:02.632 --> 36:04.849
- They said they're almost here. - Yeah, but when?

559
36:04.849 --> 36:07.340
I just told you, they're almost here.

560
36:07.340 --> 36:09.279
Why are you getting mad?

561
36:09.279 --> 36:11.903
You got mad first.

562
36:11.903 --> 36:14.029
I just asked when they'd be here.

563
36:14.029 --> 36:16.444
- And I said they're almost here... - Be quiet.

564
36:16.444 --> 36:18.143
- You started... - Knock it off!

565
36:18.143 --> 36:20.293
Hey! Hands off!

566
36:22.338 --> 36:24.035
What's wrong with you?

567
36:24.035 --> 36:27.172
These people are trustworthy, right?

568
36:27.172 --> 36:29.158
Yeah, that's what I heard.

569
36:29.158 --> 36:33.318
They say this company only hires seasoned industry veterans.

570
36:33.318 --> 36:34.925
They're the real deal.

571
36:34.925 --> 36:36.324
Don't worry.

572
36:48.521 --> 36:50.678
I didn't want to come empty-handed.

573
36:50.678 --> 36:52.191
I thought these were pretty.

574
36:52.191 --> 36:54.542
Wow, thank you.

575
36:54.542 --> 36:56.496
Hello. I'm Cha Ah Ryeong,

576
36:56.496 --> 36:59.229
- CEO of OK Planning. - Wait!

577
36:59.229 --> 37:01.593
With Ha Ri gone...

578
37:01.593 --> 37:03.293
- I'm the CEO. - What? Didn't you hear?

579
37:03.293 --> 37:04.426
I'm the CEO.

580
37:04.426 --> 37:06.363
- That was a joke... - No, I'm serious.

581
37:06.363 --> 37:09.346
- Sorry. Court ran late. - I have business cards...

582
37:09.346 --> 37:10.715
Hello.

583
37:11.626 --> 37:13.714
- Dad? - Dad?

584
37:13.714 --> 37:15.125
"Dad?"

585
37:16.744 --> 37:18.768
I'm not.

586
37:18.768 --> 37:20.454
I'm not!

587
37:21.138 --> 37:24.277
I'm single, actually...

588
37:25.147 --> 37:26.811
- I'm the CEO. - No, you're not.

589
37:26.811 --> 37:28.222
Ha Ri told me I was.

590
37:28.222 --> 37:29.848
I already had business cards made.

591
37:29.848 --> 37:32.065
I'm the CEO until Ha Ri comes back.

592
37:32.065 --> 37:32.968
Mr. Gwak...

593
37:32.968 --> 37:35.145
- What? Hey... - Enough!

594
37:35.145 --> 37:37.392
You're all too loud. Just go sit down.

595
37:38.071 --> 37:39.318
- Let's have a seat. - Yeah...

596
37:39.318 --> 37:41.871
- Okay. - Who cares who's CEO anyway...

597
37:41.871 --> 37:44.386
- Wait, were you married? - I told you, no.

598
37:44.977 --> 37:47.163
Stop staring. I'm not your dad.

599
37:47.163 --> 37:48.549
Dad...

600
37:51.835 --> 37:55.787
So our clients are pretty famous, huh?

601
37:57.106 --> 37:58.470
Oh, well...

602
37:58.470 --> 38:01.756
We're not here for autographs. Relax.

603
38:01.756 --> 38:04.933
Confidentiality always comes first.

604
38:04.933 --> 38:06.657
- Okay? - Okay.

605
38:06.657 --> 38:09.617
Okay. Shall we get started?

606
38:09.617 --> 38:10.847
Yes.

607
38:25.147 --> 38:27.796
[Lost Time, Crank Up D-25]

608
38:28.663 --> 38:30.761
Let me guess...

609
38:31.519 --> 38:33.976
Yoon Ha Na's birthday?

610
38:33.976 --> 38:35.629
So...

611
38:36.323 --> 38:37.921
It's my birthday.

612
38:37.921 --> 38:41.499
1-9-9-3-0-5-0-7.

613
38:44.408 --> 38:47.175
Knew it.

614
38:47.961 --> 38:49.448
Let's go in.

615
38:51.619 --> 38:53.405
What's all that?

616
39:10.015 --> 39:12.570
This is really sensitive...

617
39:14.248 --> 39:15.720
Just stay seated.

618
39:15.720 --> 39:16.940
I was just curious.

619
39:16.940 --> 39:20.266
I'm allergic to men.

620
39:41.577 --> 39:43.081
I knew it...

621
39:43.081 --> 39:45.028
Darn it!

622
39:46.317 --> 39:48.700
What do you have against me?

623
39:48.700 --> 39:50.835
I was just curious.

624
39:50.835 --> 39:53.864
I told you to stay seated. I'll handle it.

625
39:55.606 --> 39:57.492
I told you, I'm allergic.

626
40:09.395 --> 40:11.539
I searched everything, down to the underwear.

627
40:11.539 --> 40:13.488
This is all I found.

628
40:13.488 --> 40:15.171
These guys are professionals.

629
40:15.171 --> 40:17.684
They hid these really well.

630
40:17.684 --> 40:20.431
So there shouldn't be anything left, right?

631
40:20.431 --> 40:22.455
Don't worry.

632
40:22.455 --> 40:24.558
This is what we do...

633
40:25.972 --> 40:28.422
What's your problem?

634
40:28.422 --> 40:30.024
No, I...

635
40:31.008 --> 40:33.388
I was just curious.

636
40:34.101 --> 40:35.861
I'm done.

637
40:37.250 --> 40:39.100
I'll stay back.

638
40:45.539 --> 40:48.197
Woo Jae's place and car are clear.

639
40:48.197 --> 40:50.183
Okay.

640
40:50.183 --> 40:52.171
Ha Na, they're ready to shoot.

641
40:52.171 --> 40:54.179
- Okay. - Let's go.

642
40:56.778 --> 40:59.091
- Good work. - Good work!

643
40:59.091 --> 41:00.775
Want to grab a bite together?

644
41:00.775 --> 41:03.171
- I'd love that! - Sure.

645
41:03.171 --> 41:04.858
Actually...

646
41:04.858 --> 41:07.322
I already have plans.

647
41:07.322 --> 41:09.030
You do?

648
41:09.030 --> 41:11.206
What plans?

649
41:11.206 --> 41:12.990
I'll tell you later.

650
41:12.990 --> 41:14.997
- I'll call you. - Okay.

651
41:14.997 --> 41:16.059
Seok Min, let's go.

652
41:16.059 --> 41:18.063
- See you. - Yeah.

653
41:18.063 --> 41:20.023
Okay, Ha Na.

654
41:20.023 --> 41:21.476
I'll call you.

655
41:27.816 --> 41:30.606
I talked to Ye Rang about the stalking.

656
41:30.606 --> 41:32.446
Yeah? What did she say?

657
41:32.446 --> 41:33.656
Stalking?

658
41:33.656 --> 41:35.057
What stalking?

659
41:35.057 --> 41:37.677
Ha Na, you had a stalker?

660
41:37.677 --> 41:38.761
Since when?

661
41:38.761 --> 41:40.521
No, it's nothing.

662
41:40.521 --> 41:42.015
I'll let you go.

663
41:42.015 --> 41:43.391
2017.

664
41:43.391 --> 41:45.524
That was the first and last time.

665
41:45.524 --> 41:47.088
There was nothing after that.

666
41:47.088 --> 41:50.770
So all that persistent stalking just stopped?

667
41:51.633 --> 41:53.190
What does that mean?

668
41:53.190 --> 41:55.495
Is that a good thing?

669
41:55.495 --> 41:57.497
I don't know.

670
41:57.497 --> 42:00.271
I'm not sure it works in our favor.

671
42:01.111 --> 42:05.491
But someone still bugged the place and tracked your location.

672
42:05.491 --> 42:07.206
So what the hell is going on?

673
42:07.793 --> 42:09.648
What about Park Gi Tae?

674
42:09.648 --> 42:11.338
What did Hyeong Won say?

675
42:12.525 --> 42:13.762
He said...

676
42:13.762 --> 42:16.222
Did you look into him?

677
42:16.222 --> 42:19.888
No one from the orphanage knows anything either.

678
42:21.639 --> 42:24.302
Even the police couldn't find him. How could we?

679
42:24.302 --> 42:26.244
But that was ten years ago.

680
42:26.244 --> 42:28.268
Why are you asking about him now?

681
42:28.268 --> 42:30.063
Did something happen?

682
42:30.063 --> 42:33.101
He doesn't know much either.

683
42:38.258 --> 42:42.001
Park Gi Tae's registration was canceled five years ago.

684
42:42.001 --> 42:44.552
He's been living under stolen identities,

685
42:44.552 --> 42:46.831
changing names every so often.

686
42:46.831 --> 42:48.154
This isn't going to be easy.

687
42:48.154 --> 42:49.281
Ha Na.

688
42:49.281 --> 42:51.365
I'll do everything I can for you.

689
42:51.365 --> 42:52.948
Oh, thank you.

690
42:52.948 --> 42:56.793
Ha Na, I'll work even harder than he will.

691
42:56.793 --> 42:59.460
- Okay... - Ha Na, I...

692
43:00.644 --> 43:02.401
Who is it?

693
43:02.401 --> 43:04.611
Were you expecting anyone?

694
43:04.611 --> 43:06.048
No.

695
43:07.411 --> 43:08.971
No way...

696
43:14.301 --> 43:17.039
Oh, an actor.

697
43:39.211 --> 43:41.066
[Fourth Jump: Returns to 2026 during Woo Jae and Hyeong Won's fight]

698
44:18.094 --> 44:20.352
[If we fall into the water with that, we jump to the time of the recorded footage]

699
44:23.442 --> 44:26.838
So, just like it says here, you two traveled through time...

700
44:26.838 --> 44:31.074
and every time you did, you two switched bodies.

701
44:38.809 --> 44:40.399
Woo Jae.

702
44:44.055 --> 44:45.926
You crazy bastard, Jung Woo Jae!

703
44:45.926 --> 44:47.343
You bastard...

704
44:47.343 --> 44:49.283
What took you so long?

705
44:49.283 --> 44:51.519
Don't ever come looking for me...

706
44:52.303 --> 44:54.156
You bastard.

707
44:55.929 --> 44:58.603
We're running out of time.

708
44:58.603 --> 45:00.180
You can't get hurt.

709
45:00.180 --> 45:02.609
You can't get sick either.

710
45:02.609 --> 45:04.633
Don't protect anyone else.

711
45:04.633 --> 45:07.020
Just protect yourself, okay?

712
45:07.020 --> 45:08.737
For me...

713
45:09.456 --> 45:13.230
the fact that I can love you with everything I have...

714
45:13.230 --> 45:15.136
just gives me so much joy.

715
45:16.508 --> 45:18.198
It makes me happy.

716
45:18.198 --> 45:21.986
And not long ago, you came back from the past again.

717
45:21.986 --> 45:25.070
You two did all this to save me.

718
45:25.685 --> 45:26.999
Right?

719
45:30.026 --> 45:31.466
Yeah.

720
45:37.802 --> 45:39.106
Yeah.

721
45:39.106 --> 45:41.178
Maybe this is for the best.

722
45:42.466 --> 45:45.369
Now that everything's out in the open, I can finally ask.

723
45:45.369 --> 45:47.035
What's your deal?

724
45:47.988 --> 45:52.446
- What? - How'd you end up teaming up with Jun Mo?

725
45:52.446 --> 45:54.230
What was it again?

726
45:54.230 --> 45:56.803
Mu... music? Or something?

727
45:56.803 --> 45:57.827
Muse.

728
45:57.827 --> 45:59.553
Yeah, that.

729
46:00.150 --> 46:02.213
How did that happen?

730
46:09.377 --> 46:11.006
You and I...

731
46:11.006 --> 46:13.842
may be in different situations, but we want the same thing.

732
46:15.608 --> 46:17.260
Keeping Ha Na safe.

733
46:20.222 --> 46:22.601
What do you want me to do?

734
46:31.246 --> 46:33.385
Bring me the camcorder.

735
46:35.546 --> 46:37.467
Can you do that?

736
46:43.313 --> 46:45.313
I have one condition.

737
46:47.446 --> 46:49.706
From now on,

738
46:50.346 --> 46:51.802
you make your films with me.

739
46:51.802 --> 46:54.739
If you want, I'll even do it for life.

740
46:54.739 --> 46:56.283
What?

741
46:56.283 --> 46:59.684
Whatever script you bring me,

742
46:59.684 --> 47:02.041
you won't have to worry about production or financing.

743
47:02.041 --> 47:04.712
I'll make sure it gets a theatrical release.

744
47:05.480 --> 47:08.736
You see the deal, right?

745
47:09.998 --> 47:11.310
But...

746
47:11.310 --> 47:13.333
From this moment on,

747
47:13.333 --> 47:15.907
stay away from Ha Na.

748
47:15.907 --> 47:17.686
Whatever it is.

749
47:22.166 --> 47:23.323
Okay.

750
47:23.323 --> 47:25.250
And one more condition.

751
47:25.250 --> 47:27.136
One film.

752
47:27.749 --> 47:30.081
You have to do one film with Ha Na.

753
47:30.081 --> 47:32.027
The two of you as the leads.

754
47:33.580 --> 47:37.613
I've got a story in mind for both of you.

755
47:37.613 --> 47:40.785
And with you right there beside her,

756
47:40.785 --> 47:42.606
what could I possibly do?

757
47:43.216 --> 47:44.580
Right?

758
47:52.783 --> 47:55.069
So that's why...

759
47:55.069 --> 47:58.593
the stalking stopped.

760
48:01.651 --> 48:03.651
I'm sorry, Woo Jae.

761
48:04.444 --> 48:05.734
Why are you sorry?

762
48:05.734 --> 48:07.820
I'm the reason any of this happened.

763
48:17.098 --> 48:20.976
We're actually doing pretty great now.

764
48:20.976 --> 48:22.940
You're alive and well.

765
48:22.940 --> 48:27.617
And Ha Na and I have pretty good lives too.

766
48:27.617 --> 48:29.641
We're in a good place.

767
48:29.641 --> 48:33.922
So lighten up, okay?

768
48:38.385 --> 48:41.898
Ha Ru, you can't do judo anymore.

769
48:41.898 --> 48:45.258
Ha Na, you lost the career you worked so hard for...

770
48:45.258 --> 48:47.624
and I got to keep everything.

771
48:48.905 --> 48:50.979
Hey. I told you.

772
48:50.979 --> 48:54.965
I did enough judo. More than enough.

773
48:56.467 --> 48:57.631
Same here!

774
48:57.631 --> 49:01.284
So what about my career? I'm a lead again now.

775
49:03.174 --> 49:08.093
But you kept going back, giving up so much...

776
49:08.093 --> 49:10.559
That means the future never changed, right?

777
49:11.146 --> 49:13.110
Plus, those guys from earlier...

778
49:13.110 --> 49:16.757
Something's still not over, is it?

779
49:17.931 --> 49:20.655
- Well... that's because... - Please.

780
49:20.655 --> 49:22.375
Just stop.

781
49:26.291 --> 49:31.419
Stop giving things up because of me.

782
49:32.301 --> 49:33.968
Please.

783
49:35.252 --> 49:37.252
You're unbelievable.

784
49:38.052 --> 49:39.302
Hey.

785
49:39.302 --> 49:42.688
After all this time with us, you still don't know us?

786
49:42.688 --> 49:44.744
You think you can look at us like that...

787
49:44.744 --> 49:46.300
and say, "Please?"

788
49:46.300 --> 49:50.401
And we'll just say, "Okay?"

789
49:52.121 --> 49:55.699
Just shut up and cooperate.

790
49:55.699 --> 49:58.464
Yoon Ha Na, you explain.

791
49:58.464 --> 50:01.122
Okay. Listen carefully.

792
51:00.277 --> 51:03.134
For now, all your schedules are on hold.

793
51:03.134 --> 51:06.038
Until this blows over,

794
51:06.038 --> 51:07.872
we just have to ride it out, Eun Soo.

795
51:07.872 --> 51:10.054
I'm sorry.

796
51:11.959 --> 51:15.482
I know those articles about Eun Soo aren't true.

797
51:15.482 --> 51:18.332
You know Eun Soo better than anyone.

798
51:18.332 --> 51:20.768
The public doesn't care what's true.

799
51:20.768 --> 51:22.922
They just want someone to tear apart...

800
51:22.922 --> 51:25.361
Cut! Sorry.

801
51:25.361 --> 51:28.262
Let's give Eun Soo a little more contrast.

802
51:28.262 --> 51:29.872
We'll adjust the lighting.

803
51:29.872 --> 51:32.380
We'll touch up the makeup too.

804
51:40.160 --> 51:41.637
No trace of any transfers.

805
51:41.637 --> 51:43.850
Looks like they only dealt in cash.

806
51:43.850 --> 51:45.580
They only used TeleTalk.

807
51:45.580 --> 51:48.234
Apparently, it's nearly impossible to hack.

808
51:48.910 --> 51:50.400
Sir.

809
51:50.400 --> 51:53.194
Have those two gotten into stocks lately?

810
52:08.140 --> 52:10.239
Take a break now and then.

811
52:11.729 --> 52:13.188
Here.

812
52:19.022 --> 52:21.481
Tomorrow's finally the last shoot.

813
52:22.642 --> 52:24.119
Yeah.

814
52:24.119 --> 52:26.805
Don't you think it's a little too quiet?

815
52:26.805 --> 52:28.262
Yang Jun Mo?

816
52:28.262 --> 52:29.525
Yeah.

817
52:29.525 --> 52:32.552
We got rid of all the bugs and tracking devices.

818
52:32.552 --> 52:35.085
So why hasn't he done anything?

819
52:35.085 --> 52:37.075
Maybe he's just busy wrapping up the movie.

820
52:37.075 --> 52:39.665
Being a director and all.

821
52:39.665 --> 52:41.615
It's been too quiet.

822
52:41.615 --> 52:43.918
Honestly, it makes me nervous.

823
52:46.069 --> 52:50.455
Let's just make sure tomorrow's final shoot goes well.

824
52:50.455 --> 52:53.320
You used to work with Jun Mo a lot, right?

825
52:53.320 --> 52:55.206
You even won Best Actress.

826
52:55.206 --> 52:56.224
Well...

827
52:56.224 --> 53:00.652
I want you to get back everything you gave up because of me.

828
53:01.460 --> 53:05.973
That's why I want to see this movie through.

829
53:07.358 --> 53:08.671
Yeah.

830
53:10.785 --> 53:12.188
Sorry.

831
53:12.188 --> 53:14.008
Babe!

832
53:14.008 --> 53:15.678
Oh my.

833
53:15.678 --> 53:17.601
What are you doing here?

834
53:18.441 --> 53:20.192
What?

835
53:20.192 --> 53:22.641
You never get tired of me, do you?

836
53:22.641 --> 53:24.035
How could I?

837
53:24.035 --> 53:26.613
I fall for you all over again every time I see you.

838
53:26.613 --> 53:28.767
Even after 14 years.

839
53:30.341 --> 53:32.871
No. What are you sorry for?

840
53:32.871 --> 53:34.211
No...

841
53:34.211 --> 53:35.911
I'm so sorry.

842
53:44.663 --> 53:47.674
If you can never be wholly mine,

843
53:47.674 --> 53:49.891
I'll stop time

844
53:49.891 --> 53:55.045
and lock you away in the most perfect, eternal cage.

845
53:55.045 --> 53:57.521
My poor little ones...

846
53:57.521 --> 53:59.551
Do not grieve.

847
53:59.551 --> 54:04.707
I will lead you to true salvation.

848
54:12.291 --> 54:14.635
Enjoy! Have some hot broth too!

849
54:14.635 --> 54:16.588
- Hello! - Hi.

850
54:16.588 --> 54:17.612
I'll have tteokbokki.

851
54:17.612 --> 54:19.229
Lots of tteokbokki, please!

852
54:19.229 --> 54:21.089
Hello!

853
54:21.089 --> 54:23.119
- And some sundae, please. - Sundae!

854
54:23.119 --> 54:24.592
One, two, three!

855
54:24.592 --> 54:27.591
Nice! One, two, three!

856
54:27.591 --> 54:30.862
You know this last scene won't be easy.

857
54:30.862 --> 54:32.885
It'll be tough,

858
54:32.885 --> 54:34.415
but this is the scene

859
54:34.415 --> 54:38.012
where your rawest, most beautiful performances will live forever.

860
54:38.012 --> 54:39.455
Give it your all.

861
54:39.455 --> 54:41.711
- Yes. - Okay.

862
54:41.711 --> 54:43.415
All right.

863
54:43.415 --> 54:45.415
Let's make it count.

864
54:47.363 --> 54:49.257
Woo Jae, Ha Na.

865
54:50.237 --> 54:52.750
- You've got this. - Go for it!

866
54:54.709 --> 54:56.913
Final shoot for Lost Time.

867
54:56.913 --> 55:00.557
Day 52, Scene 121, Take 1!

868
55:02.159 --> 55:04.183
All right. Ready...

869
55:04.183 --> 55:05.316
Action!

870
55:05.953 --> 55:07.746
Yeong Hyeon.

871
55:10.452 --> 55:12.085
Oh, no...

872
55:16.168 --> 55:18.192
Eun Soo.

873
55:18.192 --> 55:19.781
I'm glad.

874
55:26.610 --> 55:28.924
Yeong Hyeon.

875
55:28.924 --> 55:31.436
Open your eyes.

876
55:31.436 --> 55:34.196
Please...

877
56:01.829 --> 56:04.307
I won't leave you alone.

878
56:04.307 --> 56:05.943
Wherever you go.

879
56:41.715 --> 56:42.883
Cut.

880
56:42.883 --> 56:44.482
Okay!

881
56:45.568 --> 56:47.034
Great job, everyone!

882
57:00.553 --> 57:02.283
Great job!

883
57:02.283 --> 57:03.831
Nice work.

884
57:04.703 --> 57:06.448
Good work, Director.

885
57:06.448 --> 57:07.658
Good work.

886
57:07.658 --> 57:08.889
I hardly did anything.

887
57:08.889 --> 57:10.869
You two did all the hard work.

888
57:10.869 --> 57:14.631
Thanks to you, the story I always dreamed of finally came to life.

889
57:14.631 --> 57:16.050
Thank you.

890
57:17.377 --> 57:18.904
I'm glad.

891
57:19.497 --> 57:21.575
Now it's all up to me.

892
57:22.550 --> 57:27.247
The real work starts now.

893
57:29.057 --> 57:31.042
- Sorry? - Huh?

894
57:32.217 --> 57:33.453
I mean the editing.

895
57:33.453 --> 57:35.130
Time to get started.

896
57:35.869 --> 57:37.360
Thanks again.

897
57:38.143 --> 57:39.556
Good job.

898
57:47.944 --> 57:50.947
Ha Na, you were amazing.

899
57:50.947 --> 57:51.948
Good job.

900
57:51.948 --> 57:53.688
Good work. That's my star!

901
57:53.688 --> 57:55.785
- It's really over now. - You did great.

902
57:55.785 --> 57:57.541
- Nice work! - Thank you all!

903
57:57.541 --> 57:59.562
We left some things behind...

904
57:59.562 --> 58:01.003
Okay. I'll start the car.

905
58:01.003 --> 58:03.669
- Okay. - See you in a bit.

906
58:05.172 --> 58:07.732
Hey, Yoon Ha Ru.

907
58:09.386 --> 58:10.598
Yeah?

908
58:11.772 --> 58:13.649
Can we talk for a second?

909
58:13.649 --> 58:15.259
Let's go!

910
58:15.259 --> 58:17.084
Hurry!

911
58:17.084 --> 58:19.140
Yeah... Sure.

912
58:22.999 --> 58:25.259
- Did you see this? - What is it?

913
58:25.259 --> 58:27.143
It's from a fan...

914
58:27.143 --> 58:28.720
Oh, really?

915
58:33.488 --> 58:35.265
That must mean a lot.

916
58:35.265 --> 58:36.647
Yeah.

917
58:37.897 --> 58:39.815
- Want me to put it in the car? - Yeah, I'll look at it later.

918
58:39.815 --> 58:41.479
- Okay. - I'll go finish up too.

919
58:41.479 --> 58:42.785
- Okay. - See you.

920
58:42.785 --> 58:44.301
See you later.

921
58:47.732 --> 58:49.198
Well...

922
58:50.185 --> 58:52.097
I saw the broadcast.

923
58:54.431 --> 58:55.823
Yeah.

924
58:56.680 --> 58:58.560
Did you mean what you said?

925
59:01.860 --> 59:03.050
You know...

926
59:03.050 --> 59:05.637
I finish really early tomorrow.

927
59:05.637 --> 59:07.661
"Really early?"

928
59:07.661 --> 59:09.621
Then what should we do tomorrow?

929
59:09.621 --> 59:10.858
Let's go get something good.

930
59:10.858 --> 59:12.426
What do you feel like?

931
59:13.071 --> 59:15.402
Let me think...

932
59:15.402 --> 59:17.316
Just name it.

933
01:00:26.732 --> 01:00:28.164
Ha Na.

934
01:00:29.015 --> 01:00:30.959
Ha Na... No...

935
01:00:30.959 --> 01:00:32.264
Ha Na.

936
01:00:33.067 --> 01:00:34.861
Ha Na!

937
01:00:36.241 --> 01:00:37.714
Yoon Ha Na!

938
01:00:38.981 --> 01:00:40.439
- What's wrong? - Ha Na!

939
01:00:40.439 --> 01:00:42.252
- Yoon Ha Na! - Ha Na...

940
01:00:50.127 --> 01:00:51.485
119?

941
01:00:51.485 --> 01:00:52.911
We're at the Ilsan set...

942
01:00:52.911 --> 01:00:55.249
It's an emergency!

943
01:00:55.249 --> 01:00:56.775
No way...

944
01:01:00.898 --> 01:01:02.691
Woo Jae...

945
01:01:13.541 --> 01:01:15.387
I love you.

946
01:01:27.063 --> 01:01:28.661
Ha Na...

947
01:01:28.661 --> 01:01:30.621
This can't be...

948
01:01:34.343 --> 01:01:36.299
Ha Na, please...

949
01:01:36.299 --> 01:01:37.476
No...

950
01:01:38.223 --> 01:01:40.413
What's going on?

951
01:01:53.375 --> 01:01:54.861
What do we do...

952
01:02:44.260 --> 01:02:47.930
Why can't anyone save you?

953
01:02:47.930 --> 01:02:50.087
Let's find a way.

954
01:02:50.087 --> 01:02:51.940
Somehow.

955
01:02:51.940 --> 01:02:53.477
Or...

956
01:02:53.477 --> 01:02:55.697
would you rather spend years in prison?

957
01:02:55.697 --> 01:02:58.467
The time machine isn't the camcorder...

958
01:02:58.467 --> 01:03:00.343
It's you?

959
01:03:02.183 --> 01:03:03.987
Yang Jun Mo, stop.

960
01:03:03.987 --> 01:03:07.046
You're ruining my work and my life.

961
01:03:07.749 --> 01:03:10.789
Aren't you curious how your story ends?
